# .env - defaults for the root of the repo's .stack (a value already exported in the shell wins); every agent and child daemon inherits them.
AOS_CLOCK=${AOS_STACK}/clock
# AOS_LLM_KERNEL and AOS_KERNEL are exported by the shell that starts this root (each machine runs its own llm kernel and permission station outside the repo); see the machine-move manual linked from wf/tree/README.md.
# No AOS_LLM_KERNEL default on purpose: if the shell forgot to export it, an agent's first brain call stops with LlmKernelMissing instead of waiting on a folder that does not exist.
# Do not set AOS_KERNEL here: the permission station belongs to each machine, not to this repo (see the manual).
# AOS_HOME is the proto8 folder these files point into; export it, or uncomment the next line and set it here.
# AOS_HOME=${HOME}/repo/aos/proto8
AOS_HOME=${AOS_HOME}
